 "seen": "Satellite z19 mosaic (0.237 m/px): the park is a wooded block (~111 x 115 m, px x 1225-1666, y 1695-2182) between 진달래마을 apartment rows (north: their gardens with sand playgrounds and a compass-rose corner plaza, treated as apartment grounds and not traced), the west road (with a black-roofed building and its parking lot in the SW corner, excluded), the green-roof building in the SE (excluded) and the south road. A round pink-brown brick plaza (~28 m) with a light grey central disk in a dark ring sits west of centre; a white shade tent stands on its north edge and curved step bands lead up to it. A brick avenue with three round tree planters runs south from the plaza to the south road. Two green hard tennis courts (fenced) lie just east of the plaza, with checkered paving on their north and west. Curving tan/grey paths loop around a central wooded mound (red-leaf maples) and join a wide grey greenway along the east edge; a small paved rest square and a bare-earth patch sit in the west wood. No children's playground is visible inside the park itself (the sand playgrounds are in the apartment gardens to the north). Paths under dense canopy are partly inferred. Benches not resolvable. Trees are left to trees.py. Web: no page or photo naming a 진달래공원 in 상동 was found (searches returned 원미산 진달래동산 and the 진달래마을 apartments only).",
